flowchart TB
  Source[Mir source: .mir files] --> Surface[Surface Mir\nsyntax and elaboration]
  Surface --> Core[Core Mir / typed IR\nexplicit placement and communication]
  Core --> Verify[Checker / proof obligations\ncontracts and invariants]
  Core --> Runtime[Mirrorea runtime\nstate, execution, evolution]
  Runtime --> Projection[Projection / deployment plan]
  Projection --> Providers[Host, provider, browser, engine adapters]
  Runtime --> Observe[Typed effects\nobservation, telemetry, redaction]

  Prism[PrismCascade] -. separate performance-sensitive kernel .-> Runtime
  Wiring[Typed-Effect Wiring Platform] -. typed external boundary .-> Providers
  Apps[Worlds / games / applications\nuser-defined concepts] --> Source

